doc:sch-1-sec-56ac-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "56AC(3) Designated sectors subject to the consumer data right" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) Despite paragraph (2)(a), treat a class of information specified as described in that paragraph as only including so much of the information in that class as:  (a) has at any time been generated or collected wholly or partly in Australia or the external Territories, and:  (i) has been so generated or collected by (or on behalf of) one or more Australian persons; or  (ii) relates to one or more Australian persons (other than the persons who so generated or collected it); or  (iii) relates to goods or services supplied, or offered for supply, to one or more Australian persons; or  (b) has only ever been generated and collected outside of Australia and the external Territories, and:  Schedule 1  Consumer data right" ;
    cof:pageNumber "8"^^xsd:integer .

