    cof:pageNumber "12"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Must consider need to prevent matters in subsection 33(2) of the Privacy Act 1988 and balance with desirability of informing interested persons. Wait at least 60 days before making the instrument after receiving a recommendation from the Information Commissioner." ;
