doc:sch-1-sec-56ao-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "56AO(3) Extraterritorial operation of the CDR provisions" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) To the extent that the CDR provisions have effect in relation to an act, or omission, relating to CDR data held outside Australia, the CDR provisions only apply if:  (a) the act or omission is by (or on behalf of) an Australian person; or  Consumer data right  Schedule 1 Main amendments  Part 1  No. 63, 2019 Treasury Laws Amendment (Consumer Data Right) Act 2019  (b) the act or omission occurs wholly or partly in Australia, or wholly or partly on board an Australian aircraft or an Australian ship; or  (c) the act or omission occurs wholly outside Australia, and an Australian person suffers, or is likely to suffer, financial or other disadvantage as a result of the act or omission. Interpretation" ;
    cof:pageNumber "18"^^xsd:integer .

concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56ao-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "56AO(4) Extraterritorial operation of the CDR provisions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-56ao-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) For the purposes of subsection (3), if a person’s act or omission includes sending, omitting to send, causing to be sent or omitting to cause to be sent an electronic communication or other thing:  (a) from a point outside Australia to a point inside Australia; or  (b) from a point inside Australia to a point outside Australia; that act or omission is taken to have occurred partly in Australia." ;
    skos:definition "(4) For the purposes of subsection (3), if a person’s act or omission includes sending, omitting to send, causing to be sent or omitting to cause to be sent an electronic communication or other thing:  (a) from a point outside Australia to a point inside Australia; or  (b) from a point inside Australia to a point outside Australia; that act or omission is taken to have occurred partly in Australia."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "2fa33ca7ee06627cd8580c6ac00acc244254e4f73ed8a3db2dd345e51c5e0edc" ;
    values:partOf concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56ao ;
    cof:pageNumber "18"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Extraterritorial operation of the CDR provisions" ;
