doc:sch-1-sec-56bh-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "56BH(3) Rules about accreditation of data recipients" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) Without limiting paragraph (1)(e), each of the following may be a ground for varying, suspending or revoking an accreditation:  (a) a failure to comply with a requirement in this Part or in the consumer data rules;  (b) a failure to comply with a requirement in the privacy safeguards. Note: An example of a variation could be the imposition of a condition, or changing the level of an accreditation." ;
