concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56bi a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "56BI Rules about reporting, record keeping and auditing"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-56bi ;
    values:originalText "(1) Without limiting paragraph 56BB(e), the consumer data rules may include the following rules:  (a) a power for a CDR consumer for CDR data to direct a CDR participant for the CDR data to give the consumer, or an accredited person, reports about:  (i) the consumer’s valid requests to the CDR participant, under rules like those described in paragraph 56BC(1)(a) or 56BG(1)(a), for the CDR data; and  (ii) any disclosures made in response to such requests;  (b) a power for a CDR consumer for CDR data to direct a CDR participant for the CDR data to give the consumer, or an accredited person, reports about:  Schedule 1  Consumer data right" ;
    skos:definition "(1) Without limiting paragraph 56BB(e), the consumer data rules may include the following rules:  (a) a power for a CDR consumer for CDR data to direct a CDR participant for the CDR data to give the consumer, or an accredited person, reports about:  (i) the consumer’s valid requests to the CDR participant, under rules like those described in paragraph 56BC(1)(a) or 56BG(1)(a), for the CDR data; and  (ii) any disclosures made in response to such requests;  (b) a power for a CDR consumer for CDR data to direct a CDR participant for the CDR data to give the consumer, or an accredited person, reports about:  Schedule 1  Consumer data right"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "675890252cdfd710cc6239f044eb0f4908c0db8cbb7f19d3f7dbdac88b19195a" ;
    cof:pageNumber "31"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Consumer has permission to direct CDR participant for reports about valid requests and disclosures." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf> ;
