doc:sch-1-sec-56bm-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "56BM(1) Infringement notices" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The object of this section is for Division 5 of Part XI to apply to a civil penalty provision of the consumer data rules in a corresponding way to the way that Division applies to a provision of Part 2-2 of the Australian Consumer Law. Note: That Division is about infringement notices issued for alleged contraventions of provisions of the Australian Consumer Law. Extended application of Division 5 of Part XI etc." ;
    cof:pageNumber "35"^^xsd:integer .

concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56bm-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "56BM(2) Infringement notices"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-56bm-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) Division 5 of Part XI, and any other provision of this Act that relates to that Division, also apply in relation to a civil penalty provision of the consumer data rules as if the substitutions in the following table were made.  Substitutions to be made Item For a reference in Division 5 of Part XI to … … substitute a reference to … section 224 of the Australian Consumer Law section 76 of this Act. Chapter 4 or Part 5-2 of the Australian Consumer Law Part VI of this Act.  Schedule 1  Consumer data right" ;
    skos:definition "(2) Division 5 of Part XI, and any other provision of this Act that relates to that Division, also apply in relation to a civil penalty provision of the consumer data rules as if the substitutions in the following table were made.  Substitutions to be made Item For a reference in Division 5 of Part XI to … … substitute a reference to … section 224 of the Australian Consumer Law section 76 of this Act. Chapter 4 or Part 5-2 of the Australian Consumer Law Part VI of this Act.  Schedule 1  Consumer data right"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "29606616c288d91d8e75ed51411160609b0524e08085a20bdba04723ee3a70c7" ;
    values:partOf concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56bm ;
    cof:pageNumber "35"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Applying provisions of Division 5 of Part XI to civil penalty provisions of the consumer data rules" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf> ;
    dc:source "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf, p.35" ;
