doc:sch-1-sec-56bn-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "56BN(3) Misleading or deceptive conduct—offence" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) An offence against subsection (1) committed by a body corporate is punishable on conviction by a fine of not more than the greater of the following:  (a) $10,000,000;  Consumer data right  Schedule 1 Main amendments  Part 1  No. 63, 2019 Treasury Laws Amendment (Consumer Data Right) Act 2019  (b) if the court can determine the value of the benefit that the body corporate, and any body corporate related to the body corporate, have obtained directly or indirectly and that is reasonably attributable to the commission of the offence—3 times the value of that benefit;  (c) if the court cannot determine the value of that benefit—10% of the annual turnover of the body corporate during the 12-month period ending at the end of the month in which the commission of the offence happened or began." ;
    cof:pageNumber "36"^^xsd:integer .

