concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56bt a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "56BT Emergency rules: consequences if made"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-56bt ;
    values:originalText "(1) If the Commission makes consumer data rules as described in subsection 56BS(1) (the emergency rules), the Commission must:  (a) on the following day, give the Minister a written explanation of the need for the emergency rules; and  (b) vary or repeal the emergency rules in accordance with any directions given under subsection (2).  (2) The Minister may, by writing, direct the Commission to vary or repeal the emergency rules.  (3) If:  (a) the emergency rules are made without consulting the Information Commissioner, but otherwise in accordance with subsection 56BS(1); and  (b) the Minister does not give a direction under subsection (2) about the emergency rules; the emergency rules cease to be in force 6 months after the day they are made.  Schedule 1  Consumer data right" ;
    skos:definition "(1) If the Commission makes consumer data rules as described in subsection 56BS(1) (the emergency rules), the Commission must:  (a) on the following day, give the Minister a written explanation of the need for the emergency rules; and  (b) vary or repeal the emergency rules in accordance with any directions given under subsection (2).  (2) The Minister may, by writing, direct the Commission to vary or repeal the emergency rules.  (3) If:  (a) the emergency rules are made without consulting the Information Commissioner, but otherwise in accordance with subsection 56BS(1); and  (b) the Minister does not give a direction under subsection (2) about the emergency rules; the emergency rules cease to be in force 6 months after the day they are made.  Schedule 1  Consumer data right"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "37ebd5757f7139985745d1c5993b3782412aac700b8b4f53f0946c83d80c62f9" ;
    cof:pageNumber "39"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56bt-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56bt-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56bt-ss-3 ;
