    cml:premiseText "(1) The Minister may, by written instrument, appoint as the Data Recipient Accreditor a person who:  (a) is the accountable authority of a Commonwealth entity (within the meaning of the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013); or  (b) is a Commonwealth entity (within the meaning of that Act). Note 2: The Commission will be the Data Recipient Accreditor in the absence of an appointment under this subsection (see the definition of Data Recipient Accreditor in subsection 4(1))." ;
    cml:executionSurface "modalities::temporal_ltl" ;
    cml:confidence "0.5000"^^xsd:decimal ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed .

