doc:sch-1-sec-56cl-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "56CL(3) Functions, powers and annual report" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) To avoid doubt, for a person who is the Accreditation Registrar, both:  (a) the person’s functions and powers in their capacity other than as the Accreditation Registrar (their primary capacity); and  (b) if the person is not a body corporate—the functions that may be performed, and the powers that may be exercised, by anyone appointed under a Commonwealth law to act as the person in that primary capacity; are taken to include the functions and powers of the Accreditation Registrar while the person is the Accreditation Registrar." ;
    cof:pageNumber "48"^^xsd:integer .

concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56cl-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "56CL(4) Functions, powers and annual report"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-56cl-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) If:  (a) a person is the Accreditation Registrar at any time during a period; and  (b) an annual report for the period is prepared under section 46 of the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013:  (i) by the person in the person’s primary capacity; or  (ii) about the person in the person’s primary capacity; the annual report must include information about the performance of the Accreditation Registrar’s functions, and the exercise of the Accreditation Registrar’s powers, at that time." ;
    skos:definition "(4) If:  (a) a person is the Accreditation Registrar at any time during a period; and  (b) an annual report for the period is prepared under section 46 of the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013:  (i) by the person in the person’s primary capacity; or  (ii) about the person in the person’s primary capacity; the annual report must include information about the performance of the Accreditation Registrar’s functions, and the exercise of the Accreditation Registrar’s powers, at that time."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "d211f73e6eae4bed899dc0cf37ed0aa4305111a3f1ad1ca78c9a85b92e7cdd61" ;
    values:partOf concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56cl ;
    cof:pageNumber "48"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Annual report must include information about Accreditation Registrar's functions and powers." ;
    dc:description "Yes" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
