concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56cn a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "56CN Delegation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-56cn ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Accreditation Registrar may delegate any or all of the Accreditation Registrar’s functions or powers to:  (a) an SES employee, or an acting SES employee, in the Department, in the Commission or in the Commonwealth entity appointed under paragraph 56CK(1)(b) (if any); or  (b) an APS employee who is holding or performing the duties of a specified office or position that:  (i) is in the Department, in the Commission or in the Commonwealth entity appointed under paragraph 56CK(1)(b) (if any); and  (ii) is an office or position that the Accreditation Registrar is satisfied is sufficiently senior for the APS employee to perform the function or exercise the power. Note: For the Registrar’s functions and powers, see section 56CE.  (2) In doing anything under a delegation under this section, the delegate must comply with any directions of the Accreditation Registrar." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Accreditation Registrar may delegate any or all of the Accreditation Registrar’s functions or powers to:  (a) an SES employee, or an acting SES employee, in the Department, in the Commission or in the Commonwealth entity appointed under paragraph 56CK(1)(b) (if any); or  (b) an APS employee who is holding or performing the duties of a specified office or position that:  (i) is in the Department, in the Commission or in the Commonwealth entity appointed under paragraph 56CK(1)(b) (if any); and  (ii) is an office or position that the Accreditation Registrar is satisfied is sufficiently senior for the APS employee to perform the function or exercise the power. Note: For the Registrar’s functions and powers, see section 56CE.  (2) In doing anything under a delegation under this section, the delegate must comply with any directions of the Accreditation Registrar."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "0cfab2f6aa3ee38f1338ccb93838efd87ffd3d285479c31b95bf2d1c78a4cc37" ;
    cof:pageNumber "50"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56cn-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56cn-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
