concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56ec-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "56EC(2) Relationship with other laws"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-56ec-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) However, the consumer data rules are taken to be consistent with the privacy safeguards to the extent that they are capable of operating concurrently. Note: This means that the privacy safeguards do not cover the field that they deal with. Relationship with the Privacy Act 1988" ;
