    skos:definition "(4) If the CDR entity is a data holder of any CDR data, the CDR entity’s policy must contain the following information:  (a) how a CDR consumer for the CDR data may access the CDR data and seek the correction of the CDR data;  Consumer data right  Schedule 1 Main amendments  Part 1  No. 63, 2019 Treasury Laws Amendment (Consumer Data Right) Act 2019  (b) how a CDR consumer for the CDR data may complain about a failure of the CDR entity to comply with this Part or the consumer data rules, and how the CDR entity will deal with such a complaint."@en ;
