    skos:definition "(1) An accredited person must not seek to collect CDR data under the consumer data rules from a CDR participant for the CDR data unless:  (a) a CDR consumer for the CDR data has requested this by giving a valid request under the consumer data rules; and  (b) the person complies with all other requirements in the consumer data rules for the collection of the CDR data from the CDR participant. Note: This subsection is a civil penalty provision (see section 56EU)."@en ;
