doc:sch-1-sec-56ej-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "56EJ(2) Privacy safeguard 7—use or disclosure of CDR data for direct" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) A designated gateway for CDR data must not use or disclose it for direct marketing unless:  (a) in the case of a disclosure—the disclosure is required under the consumer data rules; or  Schedule 1  Consumer data right" ;
