concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56ek-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "56EK(3) Privacy safeguard 8—overseas disclosure of CDR data by"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-56ek-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) For the purposes of paragraphs (1)(d) and (2)(c), assume that the privacy safeguards apply to the new recipient as if the new recipient were an accredited data recipient for the CDR data." ;
    skos:definition "(3) For the purposes of paragraphs (1)(d) and (2)(c), assume that the privacy safeguards apply to the new recipient as if the new recipient were an accredited data recipient for the CDR data."@en ;
