    skos:definition "(1) If a data holder of CDR data is required or authorised under the consumer data rules to disclose the CDR data, the data holder must take reasonable steps to ensure that the CDR data is, having regard to the purpose for which it is held, accurate, up to date and complete. Note: This subsection is a civil penalty provision (see section 56EU). Disclosures by accredited data recipients"@en ;
