doc:sch-1-sec-56ep a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "56EP Privacy safeguard 13—correction of CDR data" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "Obligation on data holders  (1) If:  (a) a CDR consumer for CDR data gives a request to a data holder of the CDR data (including a request given through a designated gateway for the CDR data); and  (b) the request is for the data holder to correct the CDR data; and  (c) the data holder was earlier required or authorised under the consumer data rules to disclose the CDR data;  Schedule 1  Consumer data right" ;
    cof:pageNumber "65"^^xsd:integer .

concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56er a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "56ER Information Commissioner may conduct an assessment"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-56er ;
    values:originalText "relating to the management and handling of CDR data  (1) The Information Commissioner may assess whether a CDR participant, or designated gateway, for CDR data is maintaining and handling the CDR data in accordance with:  (a) the privacy safeguards; or  (b) the consumer data rules to the extent that those rules relate to:  Schedule 1  Consumer data right" ;
    skos:definition "relating to the management and handling of CDR data  (1) The Information Commissioner may assess whether a CDR participant, or designated gateway, for CDR data is maintaining and handling the CDR data in accordance with:  (a) the privacy safeguards; or  (b) the consumer data rules to the extent that those rules relate to:  Schedule 1  Consumer data right"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "4e1308146f6a11799e25c4f1f0306304ded734c44ca1ec5adab5d72eea2bf9bb" ;
    cof:pageNumber "67"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "The Information Commissioner may assess whether a CDR participant or designated gateway is maintaining and handling CDR data in accordance with privacy safeguards." ;
