doc:sch-1-sec-56er a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "56ER Information Commissioner may conduct an assessment" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "relating to the management and handling of CDR data  (1) The Information Commissioner may assess whether a CDR participant, or designated gateway, for CDR data is maintaining and handling the CDR data in accordance with:  (a) the privacy safeguards; or  (b) the consumer data rules to the extent that those rules relate to:  Schedule 1  Consumer data right" ;
