    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) Each privacy safeguard penalty provision is enforceable under Part 4 of the Regulatory Powers Act. Note: Part 4 of the Regulatory Powers Act allows a civil penalty provision to be enforced by obtaining an order for a person to pay a pecuniary penalty for the contravention of the provision. Authorised applicant" ;
    cof:pageNumber "72"^^xsd:integer .

