doc:sch-1-sec-56ew-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "56EW(2) Enforceable undertakings" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) For the purposes of Part 6 of the Regulatory Powers Act, the Information Commissioner is an authorised person in relation to each provision referred to in subsection (1). Relevant court" ;
    cof:pageNumber "75"^^xsd:integer .

concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56ew-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "56EW(3) Enforceable undertakings"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-56ew-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) For the purposes of Part 6 of the Regulatory Powers Act, each of the following courts is a relevant court in relation to each provision referred to in subsection (1):  (a) the Federal Court;  (b) the Federal Circuit Court;  (c) a court of a State or Territory that has jurisdiction in relation to the matter." ;
    skos:definition "(3) For the purposes of Part 6 of the Regulatory Powers Act, each of the following courts is a relevant court in relation to each provision referred to in subsection (1):  (a) the Federal Court;  (b) the Federal Circuit Court;  (c) a court of a State or Territory that has jurisdiction in relation to the matter."@en ;
