doc:sch-1-sec-56ey-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "56EY(2) Actions for damages" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) An action under subsection (1) may be commenced at any time within 6 years after the day on which the contravention happened or began. Findings in related proceedings to be prima facie evidence" ;
    cof:pageNumber "76"^^xsd:integer .

concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56ey-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "56EY(3) Actions for damages"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-56ey-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) If a finding of any fact is made by a court in relation to a person, or an admission of any fact is made by a person, in proceedings:  Consumer data right  Schedule 1 Main amendments  Part 1  No. 63, 2019 Treasury Laws Amendment (Consumer Data Right) Act 2019  (a) under the Regulatory Powers Act (as that Act applies because of this Subdivision) in which the person is found to have contravened a provision of the privacy safeguards; or  (b) under Part VI of this Act in which the person is found to:  (i) have contravened; or  (ii) have been involved in a contravention;  of the consumer data rules to the extent that those rules relate to the privacy safeguards or to the privacy or confidentiality of CDR data; the finding or admission is prima facie evidence of that fact in any proceeding under subsection (1) against the person." ;
    skos:definition "(3) If a finding of any fact is made by a court in relation to a person, or an admission of any fact is made by a person, in proceedings:  Consumer data right  Schedule 1 Main amendments  Part 1  No. 63, 2019 Treasury Laws Amendment (Consumer Data Right) Act 2019  (a) under the Regulatory Powers Act (as that Act applies because of this Subdivision) in which the person is found to have contravened a provision of the privacy safeguards; or  (b) under Part VI of this Act in which the person is found to:  (i) have contravened; or  (ii) have been involved in a contravention;  of the consumer data rules to the extent that those rules relate to the privacy safeguards or to the privacy or confidentiality of CDR data; the finding or admission is prima facie evidence of that fact in any proceeding under subsection (1) against the person."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "1308199149c53d71651297ec7e7c7cc79eedcdbeefb7835e797f9ac18d9ea184" ;
    values:partOf concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56ey ;
    cof:pageNumber "76"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Prima facie evidence of a fact in any proceeding under subsection (1) against the person." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
