concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56ey-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "56EY(4) Actions for damages"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-56ey-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) The finding or admission may be proved by production of:  (a) in any case—a document under the seal of the court from which the finding or admission appears; or  (b) in the case of an admission—a document from which the admission appears that is filed in the court. Jurisdiction etc." ;
    skos:definition "(4) The finding or admission may be proved by production of:  (a) in any case—a document under the seal of the court from which the finding or admission appears; or  (b) in the case of an admission—a document from which the admission appears that is filed in the court. Jurisdiction etc."@en ;
