doc:sch-1-sec-56fd-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "56FD(1) Legal effect of data standards" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) A contract is taken to be in force between:  (a) a data holder of CDR data to which a binding data standard applies; and  (b) each accredited person;  Consumer data right  Schedule 1 Main amendments  Part 1  No. 63, 2019 Treasury Laws Amendment (Consumer Data Right) Act 2019  under which each of those persons:  (c) agrees to observe the standard to the extent that the standard applies to the person; and  (d) agrees to engage in conduct that the person is required by the standard to engage in. Note: This means the data holder will be taken to have a separate contract with each accredited person." ;
    cof:pageNumber "80"^^xsd:integer .

concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56fd-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "56FD(2) Legal effect of data standards"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-56fd-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) If there is a designated gateway for CDR data to which a binding data standard applies, a contract is taken to be in force between:  (a) a data holder of the CDR data; and  (b) the designated gateway for the CDR data; and  (c) each accredited person; under which each of those persons:  (d) agrees to observe the standard to the extent that the standard applies to the person; and  (e) agrees to engage in conduct that the person is required by the standard to engage in. Note: This means the data holder will be taken to have a separate 3-party contract with the designated gateway and each accredited person." ;
    skos:definition "(2) If there is a designated gateway for CDR data to which a binding data standard applies, a contract is taken to be in force between:  (a) a data holder of the CDR data; and  (b) the designated gateway for the CDR data; and  (c) each accredited person; under which each of those persons:  (d) agrees to observe the standard to the extent that the standard applies to the person; and  (e) agrees to engage in conduct that the person is required by the standard to engage in. Note: This means the data holder will be taken to have a separate 3-party contract with the designated gateway and each accredited person."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "3d117f07585447978b553643a42a21fb80ff85387f6a47314d0843f9b127fe6e" ;
    values:partOf concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56fd ;
    cof:pageNumber "80"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Agrees to observe standard and engage in conduct required by the standard." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf> ;
