concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56fj a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "56FJ Appointment of the Data Standards Body"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-56fj ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Minister may, by written instrument, appoint as the Data Standards Body:  (a) the Department; or  (b) another Commonwealth entity (within the meaning of the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013). Note: For variation, see subsection 33(3) of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901.  (2) The Minister may, at any time by written instrument, terminate an appointment made under subsection (1)." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Minister may, by written instrument, appoint as the Data Standards Body:  (a) the Department; or  (b) another Commonwealth entity (within the meaning of the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013). Note: For variation, see subsection 33(3) of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901.  (2) The Minister may, at any time by written instrument, terminate an appointment made under subsection (1)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "e1578821ba25cf045733c32dd1459ac249cb09405a11dbb9e687b2c15cfaa1ef" ;
