concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56fq a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "56FQ Resignation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-56fq ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Data Standards Chair may resign the Data Standards Chair’s appointment by giving the Minister a written resignation.  (2) The resignation takes effect on the day it is received by the Minister or, if a later day is specified in the resignation, on that later day." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Data Standards Chair may resign the Data Standards Chair’s appointment by giving the Minister a written resignation.  (2) The resignation takes effect on the day it is received by the Minister or, if a later day is specified in the resignation, on that later day."@en ;
