concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56gb a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "56GB Referring to instruments as in force from time to time"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-56gb ;
    values:originalText "(1) This section applies to the following instruments:  (a) designations under section 56AC (about designated sectors);  (b) regulations made for the purposes of a provision of this Part;  (c) the consumer data rules;  (d) data standards.  (2) An instrument to which this section applies may make provision in relation to a matter by applying, adopting or incorporating (with or without modification) any matter contained in any other instrument or writing:  (a) as in force or existing at a particular time; or  (b) as in force or existing from time to time.  (3) Subsection (2) has effect despite subsection 14(2) of the Legislation Act 2003." ;
    skos:definition "(1) This section applies to the following instruments:  (a) designations under section 56AC (about designated sectors);  (b) regulations made for the purposes of a provision of this Part;  (c) the consumer data rules;  (d) data standards.  (2) An instrument to which this section applies may make provision in relation to a matter by applying, adopting or incorporating (with or without modification) any matter contained in any other instrument or writing:  (a) as in force or existing at a particular time; or  (b) as in force or existing from time to time.  (3) Subsection (2) has effect despite subsection 14(2) of the Legislation Act 2003."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "853bc1929509bf1957b2a307593fb7e859560bc4ae8fe46980ad2abecd93cbfd" ;
    cof:pageNumber "88"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56gb-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56gb-ss-2 ;
