concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56gg a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "56GG Compensation for acquisition of property"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-56gg ;
    values:originalText "(1) This section applies if the operation of the CDR provisions would result in an acquisition of property (within the meaning of paragraph 51(xxxi) of the Constitution) from a person otherwise than on just terms (within the meaning of that paragraph).  (2) The person who acquires the property is liable to pay a reasonable amount of compensation to the first-mentioned person.  Consumer data right  Schedule 1 Main amendments  Part 1  No. 63, 2019 Treasury Laws Amendment (Consumer Data Right) Act 2019  (3) If the 2 persons do not agree on the amount of the compensation, the person to whom compensation is payable may institute proceedings in:  (a) the Federal Court; or  (b) the Supreme Court of a State or Territory; for the recovery from the other person of such reasonable amount of compensation as the Court determines." ;
    skos:definition "(1) This section applies if the operation of the CDR provisions would result in an acquisition of property (within the meaning of paragraph 51(xxxi) of the Constitution) from a person otherwise than on just terms (within the meaning of that paragraph).  (2) The person who acquires the property is liable to pay a reasonable amount of compensation to the first-mentioned person.  Consumer data right  Schedule 1 Main amendments  Part 1  No. 63, 2019 Treasury Laws Amendment (Consumer Data Right) Act 2019  (3) If the 2 persons do not agree on the amount of the compensation, the person to whom compensation is payable may institute proceedings in:  (a) the Federal Court; or  (b) the Supreme Court of a State or Territory; for the recovery from the other person of such reasonable amount of compensation as the Court determines."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c0f771a5c307c07ca15041bf55dace20216885affd43f30b2326f1886f3e3713" ;
    cof:pageNumber "92"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56gg-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56gg-ss-2 ;
