concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-16 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "16 At the end of section 26"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-16 ;
    values:originalText "Add: Delegations relating to Part IVD or the consumer data rules  (3) The Commission may, by resolution and in accordance with subsection (5), delegate any of its functions and powers under:  (a) Part VI; or  (b) Division 5 of Part XI; or  (c) section 155; to the extent that the functions or powers relate to Part IVD or the consumer data rules. Note: Division 5 of Part XI relates to the consumer data rules in the way described in section 56BM.  (4) A member of the Commission may, by writing and in accordance with subsection (5), delegate any of the member’s functions and powers under section 155 to the extent that the functions or powers relate to Part IVD or the consumer data rules.  Schedule 1  Consumer data right" ;
    skos:definition "Add: Delegations relating to Part IVD or the consumer data rules  (3) The Commission may, by resolution and in accordance with subsection (5), delegate any of its functions and powers under:  (a) Part VI; or  (b) Division 5 of Part XI; or  (c) section 155; to the extent that the functions or powers relate to Part IVD or the consumer data rules. Note: Division 5 of Part XI relates to the consumer data rules in the way described in section 56BM.  (4) A member of the Commission may, by writing and in accordance with subsection (5), delegate any of the member’s functions and powers under section 155 to the extent that the functions or powers relate to Part IVD or the consumer data rules.  Schedule 1  Consumer data right"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "397628fb2256d3878cc3ed8517042324225c1d5b7bb2adfd8178e72f91dfe68c" ;
    cof:pageNumber "99"^^xsd:integer ;
