    skos:definition "(3) The Commission may, by resolution and in accordance with subsection (5), delegate any of its functions and powers under:  (a) Part VI; or  (b) Division 5 of Part XI; or  (c) section 155; to the extent that the functions or powers relate to Part IVD or the consumer data rules. Note: Division 5 of Part XI relates to the consumer data rules in the way described in section 56BM."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f4257a041af601a85ed76346573e5ce3ee6f6019b854fab938973c8b6bc1a497" ;
