    cof:title "16(3) At the end of section 26" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) The Commission may, by resolution and in accordance with subsection (5), delegate any of its functions and powers under:  (a) Part VI; or  (b) Division 5 of Part XI; or  (c) section 155; to the extent that the functions or powers relate to Part IVD or the consumer data rules. Note: Division 5 of Part XI relates to the consumer data rules in the way described in section 56BM." ;
