concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-33 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "33 Paragraph 83(1)(b)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-33 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:  (b) in which that person has been found to have contravened, or to have been involved in a contravention of:  (i) a provision of Part IV or IVB; or  (ii) section 55B, 60C or 60K; or  (iii) subsection 56BO(1) or 56BU(1), section 56CD or a civil penalty provision of the consumer data rules.  Consumer data right  Schedule 1 Other amendments  Part 2  No. 63, 2019 Treasury Laws Amendment (Consumer Data Right) Act 2019" ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:  (b) in which that person has been found to have contravened, or to have been involved in a contravention of:  (i) a provision of Part IV or IVB; or  (ii) section 55B, 60C or 60K; or  (iii) subsection 56BO(1) or 56BU(1), section 56CD or a civil penalty provision of the consumer data rules.  Consumer data right  Schedule 1 Other amendments  Part 2  No. 63, 2019 Treasury Laws Amendment (Consumer Data Right) Act 2019"@en ;
