    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-66 ;
    values:originalText "Insert:  (9AA) A reference in this section to a designated consumer data right matter is a reference to the performance of a function, or the exercise of a power, conferred on the Commission by or under:  (a) Part IVD (other than Division 5); or  (b) regulations made under this Act for the purposes of that Part; or  (c) the consumer data rules." ;
