concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-79 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "79 After subsection 6E(1C)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-79 ;
    values:originalText "Insert: Small business operator that is accredited for the consumer data right regime  (1D) If a small business operator holds an accreditation under subsection 56CA(1) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010, this Act applies, with the prescribed modifications (if any), in relation to information that:  (a) is personal information; but  (b) is not CDR data (within the meaning of that Act); as if the small business operator were an organisation. Note: The regulations may prescribe different modifications of the Act for different small business operators. See subsection 33(3A) of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901." ;
    skos:definition "Insert: Small business operator that is accredited for the consumer data right regime  (1D) If a small business operator holds an accreditation under subsection 56CA(1) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010, this Act applies, with the prescribed modifications (if any), in relation to information that:  (a) is personal information; but  (b) is not CDR data (within the meaning of that Act); as if the small business operator were an organisation. Note: The regulations may prescribe different modifications of the Act for different small business operators. See subsection 33(3A) of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "25ce210cd93ce8e8da59ae8cf6f4ceca04994295606b5efac160a188c7356e95" ;
    cof:pageNumber "109"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Small business operator with accreditation under subsection 56CA(1) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 must apply this Act with modifications." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf> ;
